OL,3,GNEWSA'Get on with the day job' - Welsh
OL,4,ATory leader attacks first minister's
OL,5,Aindependence push
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Welsh Conservative leader Darren
OL,8,FMillar will tell the first minister to
OL,9,F"get on with the day job" instead of
OL,10,Ffocusing on the prospect of
OL,11,Findependence at a speech on Sunday.
OL,13,FDarren Millar is expected to tell the
OL,14,FConservative Party conference in
OL,15,FBirmingham that "Britain needs
OL,16,FBadenoch" and reaffirm his party's
OL,17,Fsupport for the UK.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
