OL,3,GNEWSA'Get on with the day job' - Welsh
OL,4,ATory leader attacks first minister's
OL,5,Aindependence push
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after First Minister Rhun ap
OL,8,FIorwerth called for a "new deal" for
OL,9,FWales from the UK government at a Plaid
OL,10,FCymru conference, and said at a rally
OL,11,Fthere was "no turning back" on the
OL,12,Findependence journey.
OL,14,FMillar will say in his speech that his
OL,15,Fparty is committed to keeping the UK
OL,16,Ftogether and that Britain's legacy
OL,17,Fshould be used to inspire future
OL,18,Fgenerations.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
